on 5 Jan 2026, so the owner may have changed since.\n- I couldn't open the per-account ticket folders (accounts/marrow-agrisupply and accounts/marrow-fieldworks). The file listing only returned team and member files, so the CRM ticket queues aren't covered. Moss offered to pull full ticket transcripts from the CRM before the handoff, and that's the best way to get a complete list.\n- #general and #help-it-ops had no relevant posts.\n- Nothing I found contains money terms, so the list has no finance figures."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
